  "prefLabel": "Pes 305.02 Reports of Pesticide Use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 305.02 Reports of Pesticide Use. Applicants for private applicator permits shall, at the time of submittal of a permit application for annual renewal, report all pesticide use pursuant to Pes 901.04.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss and moved by #4812, eff 5-3-90; amd by #4867, eff 7-19-90; amd by #5734, eff 11-5-93; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
